<title>POLAND: PLI Q4 net rises to PLN 8.2 mln.</title>
<headline>PLI Q4 net rises to PLN 8.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLI results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			  1.57  vs    1.29 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 10.40  vs    1.80</p>
<p>    net profit				6.23  vs    1.05</p>
<p>    net sales				12.58  vs   10.91</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 11.46  vs    9.79</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				5.3   vs    0.85</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   26.85  vs    3.30</p>
<p>    financial costs			14.23  vs    0.40</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.0   vs    0.0</p>
<p>    investment			     21.02  vs    9.07</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			1.57  vs    0.64</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 13.48  vs    2.19</p>
<p>    net profit				8.17  vs    1.33</p>
<p>    net sales				40.72  vs   22.46</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 31.80  vs   19.25</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				5.31  vs    0.85</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   26.85  vs    3.30</p>
<p>    financial costs			14.94  vs    1.75</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.0   vs    0.0</p>
<p>    investment				n.a   vs    n.a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polish Life Improvement SA</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
